      "section": "cubbie-mkt-hero",
      "hiddenState": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring assignments, course materials, school email, your calendar and reminders into one conversation. Cubbie helps you find what matters, see what comes next and stay in charge of your work.",
      "tag": "p",
      "section": "cubbie-mkt-hero",
