    {
      "text": "Schoolwork shouldn’t live in five different places",
      "tag": "h2",
      "section": "problem",
      "hiddenState": false
    },
    {
      "text": "An assignment is posted in Canvas. A professor moves the due date in an announcement. A group update arrives by email. Your study plan sits in another calendar. By the time you’ve pieced it together, the actual work hasn’t started.",
      "tag": "p",
      "section": "problem",
      "hiddenState": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Cubbie cuts down that switching. It brings the school accounts you connect into one student planner you text, so you can see the task, understand it and decide what to do next.",
      "tag": "p",
      "section": "problem",
      "hiddenState": false
    },
    {
